---
// Theme 1 drawing, Interoperable Digital Twins: three source models (BIM, energy model, automation) stand on one
// iso plinth and map, along the accent path, into one ontology graph, the hero. Each source's top face and its
// graph node share the tint.
// Used on the homepage theme card, the /research/ card and the theme page. Classes: .dg in global.css; elements
// with .dt are secondary detail, hidden on the homepage cards. Generated by build.py in
// personal-website/research/compare-2026-10-30-theme-drawings/tools/ (outside this repository).
---
